// Coil feel test - ESP32 + L298N
// Coil A (OUT1/OUT2): IN1 = GPIO 25, IN2 = GPIO 26
// Coil B (OUT3/OUT4): IN3 = GPIO 27, IN4 = GPIO 32
// Serial Monitor @ 115200:
//   f/r = kick A fwd/rev (40 ms)    h/j = HOLD A fwd/rev (300 ms)
//   g/v = kick B fwd/rev
//   b/c = kick BOTH fwd/rev         n/m = HOLD BOTH fwd/rev (300 ms)

const int CA1 = 25, CA2 = 26;   // coil A
const int CB1 = 27, CB2 = 32;   // coil B

const int KICK_MS = 40;
const int HOLD_MS = 300;
const int HOLD_COOLDOWN_MS = 2000;

void allOff() {
  digitalWrite(CA1, LOW); digitalWrite(CA2, LOW);
  digitalWrite(CB1, LOW); digitalWrite(CB2, LOW);
}

void drive(bool useA, bool useB, bool forward, int ms) {
  if (useA) { digitalWrite(CA1, forward ? HIGH : LOW); digitalWrite(CA2, forward ? LOW : HIGH); }
  if (useB) { digitalWrite(CB1, forward ? HIGH : LOW); digitalWrite(CB2, forward ? LOW : HIGH); }
  delay(ms);
  allOff();
  Serial.print(useA ? "A " : "");
  Serial.print(useB ? "B " : "");
  Serial.print(forward ? "FWD " : "REV ");
  Serial.print(ms);
  Serial.println(" ms");
}

void setup() {
  pinMode(CA1, OUTPUT); pinMode(CA2, OUTPUT);
  pinMode(CB1, OUTPUT); pinMode(CB2, OUTPUT);
  allOff();
  Serial.begin(115200);
  delay(500);
  Serial.println("\nCoil feel test ready.");
  Serial.println("f/r kick A | h/j hold A | g/v kick B | b/c kick both | n/m hold both");
}

void loop() {
  if (!Serial.available()) return;
  char c = Serial.read();

  switch (c) {
    case 'f': drive(true,  false, true,  KICK_MS); break;
    case 'r': drive(true,  false, false, KICK_MS); break;
    case 'g': drive(false, true,  true,  KICK_MS); break;
    case 'v': drive(false, true,  false, KICK_MS); break;
    case 'b': drive(true,  true,  true,  KICK_MS); break;
    case 'c': drive(true,  true,  false, KICK_MS); break;
    case 'h': drive(true,  false, true,  HOLD_MS); delay(HOLD_COOLDOWN_MS); break;
    case 'j': drive(true,  false, false, HOLD_MS); delay(HOLD_COOLDOWN_MS); break;
    case 'n': drive(true,  true,  true,  HOLD_MS); delay(HOLD_COOLDOWN_MS); break;
    case 'm': drive(true,  true,  false, HOLD_MS); delay(HOLD_COOLDOWN_MS); break;
    default: break;
  }

  while (Serial.available()) Serial.read();
}
